<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1965919483"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1634197972"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Be Crazy For Me"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="96猫"/><amll:meta key="album" value="パリピ孔明 VOCAL COLLECTION MEGAMORI!!"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="04:49.827"><div begin="00:33.437" end="04:46.673"><p begin="00:33.437" end="00:34.523" itunes:key="L183">Be crazy for me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为我疯狂</span></p><p begin="00:34.595" end="00:36.812" itunes:key="L185">Make me shine on you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我的光芒为你照亮</span></p><p begin="00:36.970" end="00:40.355" itunes:key="L186">You're gonna see me when you hear my music<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">听见我的歌声 你就会看见我</span></p><p begin="00:40.607" end="00:41.969" itunes:key="L187">I'll be there for you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无论你要去何方</span></p><p begin="00:42.074" end="00:43.745" itunes:key="L188">No matter where you go<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我都会在你身旁</span></p><p begin="00:43.790" end="00:46.958" itunes:key="L189">How do you see me from your point of view<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你对我有什么样的想法</span></p><p begin="00:47.010" end="00:48.910" itunes:key="L190">I steal your heart<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我偷走了你的心</span></p><p begin="00:51.305" end="00:52.502" itunes:key="L191">I'll take you higher<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会带你飞得更高</span></p><p begin="00:53.473" end="00:55.382" itunes:key="L192">Are you crazy for me?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你为我疯狂了吗</span></p><p begin="00:57.985" end="00:59.265" itunes:key="L193">I'll take you higher<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会带你飞得更高</span></p><p begin="01:00.221" end="01:02.070" itunes:key="L194">Are you crazy for me?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你为我疯狂了吗</span></p><p begin="01:02.281" end="01:03.932" itunes:key="L195">Let me go my own way<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我坚持我的道路</span></p><p begin="01:03.994" end="01:05.595" itunes:key="L196">'Cause I believe you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为我对你信心十足</span></p><p begin="01:05.761" end="01:08.926" itunes:key="L197">未完成のままじゃイヤなの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不喜欢不圆满的结局</span></p><p begin="01:09.100" end="01:10.769" itunes:key="L198">Don't let it fade away<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不要放弃心中的梦</span></p><p begin="01:10.794" end="01:12.444" itunes:key="L199">I'll make it come true<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会让美梦成真</span></p><p begin="01:12.603" end="01:15.822" itunes:key="L200">でもつかむには足りないの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">现在的我还无法抓住梦想</span></p><p begin="01:15.995" end="01:18.842" itunes:key="L201">可能性なら無限大<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但是却拥有无穷的可能性</span></p><p begin="01:18.867" end="01:22.577" itunes:key="L202">賭けてみて、裏切らない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">试着赌上一切 绝不辜负</span></p><p begin="01:22.833" end="01:25.713" itunes:key="L203">その思いには応えたい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想要回应你的期待</span></p><p begin="01:25.803" end="01:29.571" itunes:key="L204">君の声で bring it to me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">用你的声音为我欢呼</span></p><p begin="01:30.125" end="01:31.158" itunes:key="L205">Be crazy for me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为我疯狂</span></p><p begin="01:31.165" end="01:33.321" itunes:key="L206">Make me shine on you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我的光芒为你照亮</span></p><p begin="01:33.497" end="01:36.929" itunes:key="L207">You're gonna see me when you hear my music<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">听见我的歌声 你就会看见我</span></p><p begin="01:37.130" end="01:38.492" itunes:key="L208">I'll be there for you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无论你要去何方</span></p><p begin="01:38.699" end="01:40.361" itunes:key="L209">No matter where you go<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我都会在你身旁</span></p><p begin="01:40.410" end="01:43.702" itunes:key="L210">How do you see me from your point of view<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你对我有什么样的想法</span></p><p begin="01:43.830" end="01:47.086" itunes:key="L211">Oh baby, tell me everything's alright<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">宝贝 告诉我</span></p><p begin="01:47.262" end="01:50.829" itunes:key="L212">I hope nobody wastes his time tonight<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我希望今晚没有人荒度光阴</span></p><p begin="01:50.838" end="01:52.286" itunes:key="L213">Make you feel so good<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会让你感觉心花怒放</span></p><p begin="01:52.349" end="01:54.105" itunes:key="L214">I'll never let you go<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我绝对不会放弃你</span></p><p begin="01:54.304" end="01:57.218" itunes:key="L215">If you leave me I don't forgive you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你要是离开了我 我不会原谅</span></p><p begin="01:57.220" end="01:59.185" itunes:key="L216">I steal your heart<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我偷走了你的心</span></p><p begin="02:01.371" end="02:02.777" itunes:key="L217">I'll take you higher<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会带你飞得更高</span></p><p begin="02:03.846" end="02:05.571" itunes:key="L218">Are you crazy for me?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你为我疯狂了吗</span></p><p begin="02:08.186" end="02:09.593" itunes:key="L219">I'll take you higher<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会带你飞得更高</span></p><p begin="02:10.565" end="02:12.369" itunes:key="L220">Are you crazy for me?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你为我疯狂了吗</span></p><p begin="02:12.522" end="02:14.254" itunes:key="L221">I wanna rock with you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想要和你一起摇摆</span></p><p begin="02:14.334" end="02:15.812" itunes:key="L222">We feel the heat beat<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们感受到了怦怦跳动的心脏</span></p><p begin="02:15.974" end="02:19.257" itunes:key="L223">時計なんか外しちゃえば<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">尽管抛开时间的限制吧</span></p><p begin="02:19.401" end="02:21.030" itunes:key="L224">I sing a song for you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会为你唱一首歌</span></p><p begin="02:21.166" end="02:22.724" itunes:key="L225">Party at it's peak<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">派对到达高潮</span></p><p begin="02:22.873" end="02:26.180" itunes:key="L226">ユメミ心地にさせたげる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会让你体验神魂颠倒的感受</span></p><p begin="02:26.300" end="02:29.194" itunes:key="L227">盛り上がんなきゃつまんない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">气氛不够热烈那该有多么无趣</span></p><p begin="02:29.207" end="02:32.955" itunes:key="L228">目の前に君がいるの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你就在我的眼前</span></p><p begin="02:33.132" end="02:36.020" itunes:key="L229">精一杯ただ伝えたい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想竭力向你传达</span></p><p begin="02:36.147" end="02:40.286" itunes:key="L230">このすべてを show you my soul<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">向你传达我的一切 我的灵魂</span></p><p begin="02:40.397" end="02:41.440" itunes:key="L231">Be crazy for me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为我疯狂</span></p><p begin="02:41.450" end="02:43.593" itunes:key="L232">Make me shine on you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我的光芒为你照亮</span></p><p begin="02:43.806" end="02:47.241" itunes:key="L233">You're gonna see me when you hear my music<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">听见我的歌声 你就会看见我</span></p><p begin="02:47.448" end="02:48.833" itunes:key="L234">I'll be there for you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无论你要去何方</span></p><p begin="02:48.972" end="02:50.612" itunes:key="L235">No matter where you go<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我都会在你身旁</span></p><p begin="02:50.645" end="02:53.958" itunes:key="L236">How do you see me from your point of view<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你对我有什么样的想法</span></p><p begin="02:54.092" end="02:57.411" itunes:key="L237">Oh baby, tell me everything's alright<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">宝贝 告诉我</span></p><p begin="02:57.537" end="03:01.009" itunes:key="L238">I hope nobody wastes his time tonight<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我希望今晚没有人荒度光阴</span></p><p begin="03:01.190" end="03:02.566" itunes:key="L239">Make you feel so good<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会让你感觉心花怒放</span></p><p begin="03:02.715" end="03:04.315" itunes:key="L240">I'll never let you go<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我绝对不会放弃你</span></p><p begin="03:04.569" end="03:07.492" itunes:key="L241">If you leave me, I don't forgive you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你要是离开了我 我不会原谅</span></p><p begin="03:07.606" end="03:09.468" itunes:key="L242">I steal your heart<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我偷走了你的心</span></p><p begin="03:22.709" end="03:25.992" itunes:key="L243">You're gonna know when I sing with all my heart<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当我全心全意开始歌唱 你就会知道</span></p><p begin="03:26.024" end="03:29.409" itunes:key="L244">You must be crazy for me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你一定会为我疯狂</span></p><p begin="03:29.609" end="03:30.953" itunes:key="L245">I give you my word<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我向你保证</span></p><p begin="03:31.010" end="03:32.909" itunes:key="L246">My dream is top the chart<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的梦想是成为顶尖歌手</span></p><p begin="03:32.919" end="03:36.217" itunes:key="L247">You must be crazy for me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你一定会为我疯狂</span></p><p begin="03:36.307" end="03:39.627" itunes:key="L248">You will be my wings, take me to the place<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你会成为我的翅膀</span></p><p begin="03:39.769" end="03:42.907" itunes:key="L249">Get together, ride my beat<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">和我一起 跟上节奏</span></p><p begin="03:43.153" end="03:46.502" itunes:key="L250">Let me take this chance to thank you for the dance<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我抓住这机会</span></p><p begin="03:46.635" end="03:50.203" itunes:key="L251">I will keep your eyes on me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会让你的目光聚焦在我身上</span></p><p begin="03:50.699" end="03:51.773" itunes:key="L252">Be crazy for me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为我疯狂</span></p><p begin="03:51.783" end="03:53.939" itunes:key="L253">Make me shine on you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我的光芒为你照亮</span></p><p begin="03:54.105" end="03:57.561" itunes:key="L254">You're gonna see me when you hear my music<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">听见我的歌声 你就会看见我</span></p><p begin="03:57.745" end="03:59.179" itunes:key="L255">I'll be there for you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无论你要去何方</span></p><p begin="03:59.302" end="04:00.958" itunes:key="L256">No matter where you go<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我都会在你身旁</span></p><p begin="04:00.966" end="04:04.214" itunes:key="L257">How do you see me from your point of view<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你对我有什么样的想法</span></p><p begin="04:04.410" end="04:05.363" itunes:key="L258">Be crazy for me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为我疯狂</span></p><p begin="04:05.499" end="04:07.710" itunes:key="L259">Make me shine on you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我的光芒为你照亮</span></p><p begin="04:07.830" end="04:11.217" itunes:key="L260">You're gonna see me when you hear my music<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">听见我的歌声 你就会看见我</span></p><p begin="04:11.411" end="04:12.851" itunes:key="L261">I'll be there for you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无论你要去何方</span></p><p begin="04:12.990" end="04:14.638" itunes:key="L262">No matter where you go<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我都会在你身旁</span></p><p begin="04:14.846" end="04:17.974" itunes:key="L263">How do you see me from your point of view<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你对我有什么样的想法</span></p><p begin="04:18.134" end="04:21.395" itunes:key="L264">Oh baby, tell me everything's alright<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">宝贝 告诉我</span></p><p begin="04:21.542" end="04:24.847" itunes:key="L265">I hope nobody wastes his time tonight<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我希望今晚没有人荒度光阴</span></p><p begin="04:25.121" end="04:26.603" itunes:key="L266">Make you feel so good<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会让你感觉心花怒放</span></p><p begin="04:26.734" end="04:28.326" itunes:key="L267">I'll never let you go<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我绝对不会放弃你</span></p><p begin="04:28.570" end="04:31.462" itunes:key="L268">If you leave me, I don't forgive you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你要是离开了我 我不会原谅</span></p><p begin="04:31.603" end="04:33.414" itunes:key="L269">I steal your heart<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我偷走了你的心</span></p><p begin="04:35.835" end="04:37.177" itunes:key="L270">I'll take you higher<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会带你飞得更高</span></p><p begin="04:38.029" end="04:39.841" itunes:key="L271">Are you crazy for me?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你为我疯狂了吗</span></p><p begin="04:42.399" end="04:43.769" itunes:key="L272">I'll take you higher<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会带你飞得更高</span></p><p begin="04:44.774" end="04:46.673" itunes:key="L273">Are you crazy for me?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你为我疯狂了吗</span></p></div></body></tt>